Subject: Creating a new agency
Hi Shir,
Regarding making the connection - we only need your approval, Talma''s approval, the agent''s details, and which rotations to connect Talma to.
Do note that currently you automatically send travel requests to Signal, so if we simply connect Talma in addition to them travel requests will automatically be sent to both agencies at the
same time.', 6);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[knowledge_chunks] ([id],[document_id],[content],[chunk_index]) VALUES (NEWID(), '8fd6bbd2-893f-410b-85de-3b884c2a20e4', N'o note that currently you automatically send travel requests to Signal, so if we simply connect Talma in addition to them travel requests will automatically be sent to both agencies at the
same time.
To avoid this issue while still connecting more than one agency to the same rotation, you''ll need to disable the automatic sending of travel requests and manually send them to the agents.
You''ll need to do so for every Tas you open using the Mail TR To agent button in the Travel Request screen:
-Reservations-
Travel Request
Proposals
Abroad
Expenses
Done
Preview of Travel Request
Through there you''ll be able to choose which services to send to which agency.
Kind regards,
Tamir.
