Hi Oren,
@ComBTAS Team pls. advise.
From: Oren Tepper <orent@nayax.com>
Sent: Thursday, November 21, 2024 10:19 AM
To: Enon Halperin <enonh@nayax.com>; Eden Luzon <Edenl@nayax.com>
Subject: TAS Expense without a receipt
Eden,
I have a case in which I have an expense for In-flight Internet with Hainan airlines during a flight to Shenzen without a receipt. I didn''t get it to
my mail and there is no practical way I could find to get this receipt from them.', 0);
INSERT INTO [dbo].[knowledge_chunks] ([id],[document_id],[content],[chunk_index]) VALUES (NEWID(), 'f616c726-392b-408c-9801-ba3a30dd6f84', N'expense for In-flight Internet with Hainan airlines during a flight to Shenzen without a receipt. I didn''t get it to
my mail and there is no practical way I could find to get this receipt from them.
The TAS doesn''t allow to continue with an expense without having a receipt. In my former place we had several such cases including taxi
drivers that doesn''t give receipt etc., we should have an option to tick a box and say that we don''t have receipt and declare the expense.
For now I added a dummy receipt on the expense in order to close the report and submit it. Please kindly take care.
Thanks,
Nayax
Oren Tepper
Chief Commercial Officer
