Subject: RE: TAS Expense without a receipt
Hi Eden,
Just to be sure - you''re asking to allow travellers to submit expenses without receipts?
Will this apply to all expenses in all Tas?
Kind regards,
Tamir.
From: Eden Luzon <edenl@nayax.com>
Sent: 13:06 Thursday 21 November, 2024
To: <support@combtas.com>, Oren Tepper <Orent@nayax.com>, Enon Halperin <enonh@nayax.com>
Cc: Hila Tamir <hilat@tripex.io>
Subject: RE: TAS Expense without a receipt
