Hi Nitzan,
This appears to be related to the incident in which you accidentally deleted the Kornit EU General rotation.
This Tas was sent for approval while the rotation was deleted, before it was restored, which caused it to be approved without a rotation.
If you''ll use Actions->Change, then resend it for approval it''ll go through the appropriate approval rotation.
If you with to cancel its interface, please first delete on on your end so that you won''t have it as duplicate.
Kind regards,
Tamir.
